Z||000015||1FST2M6||12-11-2000||11:38 AM||||i have a Kart that has 27hp out of a 5hp briggs. i bought it from HMS motorsports in Dalton, Ga. it runs on Methanol.  Weisco piston, precision cam, Horstman rod and stock carb rejetted for methanol. but you can run methanol int eh stock carb with out changing the jets or the diaphram. just run it 60%gas and 40% methanol.. with nitromethane i'd stick to more like 80%gas and 20% nitro. it's EXPONENTIALY more explosive then the gas... and may burn a hole in the piston... not like it's a big deal.. a weico piston for it is only $60 OOh big sender!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> the carb diaphram kits from <A HREF="http://www.northerntool.com" TARGET=_blank>www.northerntool.com</A>  are $3.19 a set... expect to rebuild it about every 5-6 tank fuls. the fuel will eat the diaphram. they make a couple different kinds.. the stock paper, and a fiber reinforced rubber. the rubber one will turn to goo the paper one will just tear... i've run the paper in my car for about a year changine it once a month... (takes MAYBE 5min with a phillips screwdriver)    the HSC kit is SWEEEET!   <A HREF="http://www.4cycle.com" TARGET=_blank>www.4cycle.com</A>  for more go fast tips and tricks. you'll also fine the IHI2-1e turbo kit!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> for another STOOOOOPID fast idea!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
